OMNeT++ Experiment 25
Title: Ad Hoc Routing: Proactive (DSDV) versus Reactive (AODV)

Description:
Compares proactive route-table updates with reactive route discovery using sample network traffic and route metrics.

Project source files:
- Experiment_25.ned  (NED network and simple module)
- Experiment_25.cc   (C++ simulation module)
- omnetpp.ini           (simulation configuration)

Run in an installed OMNeT++ project:
  opp_makemake
  make
  ./Experiment25Network -u Cmdenv -f omnetpp.ini

NOTE: Graph and console images in this folder are prepared demonstration artifacts.
Run this project in OMNeT++ to obtain environment-specific simulation logs and vectors.
